{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56333","headline":"题鼎湖山 · 季仲砥","name":"题鼎湖山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫阳洞府压青山，白日骑龙去不还。\n轩辕丹竈□□识，烧得金丹奉帝颜。\n（见《吟窗杂录》卷四九。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"季仲砥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}